    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d394-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d394-f1-content">
                <p>The words in the upper right corner “T[ehran]-misc[ellanous]” were added
                    subsequently as a file indicator. The writing enclosed in the circles reads: “40
                    U. N.”, “Exec[utive] Com[mittee]”, and “4 Police [men]”. The words below the
                    left-hand circle are “I[nternational] L[abor] O[rganization]-Health
                    Agric[ulture]-Food”.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
